      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرِيعٌ</span></b>  [<i>i. q.</i> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَزْرُوعٌ</span></b>  <i>Sown:</i> &amp;c.: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرِيعَةٌ</span>]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<i>Seed produce that is watered by the rain.</i> (Ham
p. 657.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And hence, (tropical:)  Anything <i>soft,</i> or <i>tender;</i> as being likened thereto. (Id.)

